      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Pebble Beach Golf Links hosts the AT&T Pebble Beach Pro‑Am each year and is part of a resort that includes the 1919 Lodge at Pebble Beach.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
